      flowers: "Showy rose-pink to magenta, 4 petals, in a tall terminal raceme opening from the bottom up.",
      fruit: "Long, slender reddish pods splitting to release many silky-plumed wind-borne seeds.",
      root: "Spreading rhizomes forming colonies.",
      aroma: "Faint, green/vegetal; no milky latex.",
      height: "Commonly 90–180 cm, occasionally to ~270 cm.",
      keyFeatures: ["Tall spike of 4-petalled magenta flowers blooming bottom-up", "Willow-like leaves with looping marginal veins", "Reddish smooth stem", "Watery (not milky) sap", "Colonial on burns/disturbed ground"],
