    seasonCue: { tempSensitive: true, notes: "Each edible part has its own narrow window that shifts later at altitude: peeled young shoots in late spring/early summer, green (immature) flower spikes early summer, bright yellow pollen for a week or two at flowering, and starchy rhizomes from fall through winter." },
